# Input
```astro
---
let constant = "constant";
let written = "before";
let mutated = 0;
let assignedLater;
function nested() {
    let nestedConstant = "nested";
    return nestedConstant;
}
---
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
{constant}
{written = "after"}
{mutated += 1}
{assignedLater = "later"}

